          <groundspeak:finder id="7458582">mkPerry</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP720 St Albert Cito 2

Out grabbing a few more BCPs on the last day for logging them. We parked in the nearby lot and walked to GZ. Knew where it was supposed to be but the rain last night had filled the back of curb with mud. Walked back to the car to get the trowel and then quickly exposed it as it was just below the surface. Cap itself is in good shape. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks outforthehunt for all the BCPs and the fun I've had over the last couple weeks getting most of the ones in the Edmonton area. &lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
